  "description": "<p>The Academy of Learning is a Canadian higher education provider that offers courses for adult learners. Initially, the establishment offered computer and business skills training for adult learners. But the Academy has now grown to 50 campuses across Canada. Today, the institution has helped students complete over one million training courses. It is also ranked among the top 200 higher education providers in Canada.</p><p>Through the various locations, students can access Diploma-level and Certificate-level programs. Currently, courses are available in Accounting, Business, Community Support Worker, Customer Service, Healthcare, Information Technology, Insurance, Legal, Web Design and more.</p> <p>As the Academy, Scarborough supports online and remote learning, the Integrated Learning System is one of the establishment's main resources. Via the learning system, students access course materials and instruction from tutors.</p><p>In addition, the system provides multi-sensory learning styles and preferences. These are accessible through specific course workbooks, media presentations and hands-on exercises.</p> <p><strong>Student Life</strong></p> <p>The Academy of Learningâ€™s mission is to provide flexible courses to suit a work-life balance. As a result, studentsâ€™ time is split between remote learning and on-campus study. But, whilst on campus, students will find a warm and friendly learning environment with professional and knowledgeable staff.&nbsp;</p><p>At the Scarborough campus, students can get one-to-one support from a designated tutor and access all on-campus facilities. In addition, a welcoming and friendly student community exists on campus, where students can meet like-minded coursemates.</p>",
